\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Cascade, official WP1 48-round egreedy diagnostic at $P=0.25$, $\pi =1$, seeds 0--19; not part of Decision A and not counted toward result 1. At $a=0$, mean $\mathrm  {E}=0.005877$ and $\mathrm  {Q}=0.553009$. All eight $\mathrm  {Q}$ cells are identifiable as reported (12--14/20 tail-trade runs). Deltas are audit-minus-$a=0$; intervals are same-seed paired-bootstrap 95\% CIs ($B=10{,}000$). $^{*}$: significant decrease under the official 42-test router $\times $ learner $\times \pi $ report family, pooling all penalties and both metrics. Stored zero raw values are written $<2\times 10^{-4}$ (two-sided resolution $2/B$); zero Holm values have bound $\le 42\cdot 2/B=0.0084$, printed $\le 0.009$.}}{15}{table.caption.82}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:wp1-cascade}{{13}{15}{Cascade, official WP1 48-round egreedy diagnostic at $P=0.25$, $\pi =1$, seeds 0--19; not part of Decision A and not counted toward result 1. At $a=0$, mean $\Emet =0.005877$ and $\Qmet =0.553009$. All eight $\Qmet $ cells are identifiable as reported (12--14/20 tail-trade runs). Deltas are audit-minus-$a=0$; intervals are same-seed paired-bootstrap 95\% CIs ($B=10{,}000$). $^{*}$: significant decrease under the official 42-test router $\times $ learner $\times \pi $ report family, pooling all penalties and both metrics. Stored zero raw values are written $<2\times 10^{-4}$ (two-sided resolution $2/B$); zero Holm values have bound $\le 42\cdot 2/B=0.0084$, printed $\le 0.009$}{table.caption.82}{}}
