\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces v1.0 48-round baseline Pareto view: $(\mathrm  {E},\mathrm  {Q})$ at $\pi =1$ (a) and $\pi =0.1$ (b), 40 sellers. Points are means over $n=20$ seeds; bars are 95\% paired-bootstrap CIs (10,000 resamples). The five audit arms share one colour and overlap at low $\mathrm  {E}$ (values in Table\nonbreakingspace \ref {tab:t1-v10}). Solid: 17--20/20 tail-trade runs; half-filled: audits (12--13/20); cheapest is hollow (0/20) and is not on the two-dimensional front---read it along $\mathrm  {E}$ only. ``Identifiable'' means $\texttt  {tail\_trade\_rate}>0.5$ (a protocol trade-support screen, not statistical identifiability). Means include all 20 seeds. Front membership is not concluded; no winner is declared.}}{16}{figure.caption.87}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pareto}{{3}{16}{v1.0 48-round baseline Pareto view: $(\Emet ,\Qmet )$ at $\pi =1$ (a) and $\pi =0.1$ (b), 40 sellers. Points are means over $n=20$ seeds; bars are 95\% paired-bootstrap CIs (10,000 resamples). The five audit arms share one colour and overlap at low $\Emet $ (values in Table~\ref {tab:t1-v10}). Solid: 17--20/20 tail-trade runs; half-filled: audits (12--13/20); cheapest is hollow (0/20) and is not on the two-dimensional front---read it along $\Emet $ only. ``Identifiable'' means $\texttt {tail\_trade\_rate}>0.5$ (a protocol trade-support screen, not statistical identifiability). Means include all 20 seeds. Front membership is not concluded; no winner is declared}{figure.caption.87}{}}
